# Keep large generated artifacts out of implicit context reads. These are not
# access barriers — go read them when you have a reason to; they just stop the
# harness pulling them in on its own. Write traffic into the workspace also
# invalidates the prompt cache.

# The graphify knowledge graph: large, generated, point-in-time.
graphify-out/

# The beads database, hooks and backups behind the `work` facade. Addressed
# through `work`, never read directly.
.beads/
